    <title>开启或关闭Windows休眠</title>
    <link href="/posts/c5fbb796.html"/>
    <url>/posts/c5fbb796.html</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="开启或关闭Windows休眠"><a href="#开启或关闭Windows休眠" class="headerlink" title="开启或关闭Windows休眠"></a>开启或关闭Windows休眠</h1><h3 id="关闭Windows休眠命令"><a href="#关闭Windows休眠命令" class="headerlink" title="关闭Windows休眠命令"></a>关闭Windows休眠命令</h3><figure class="highlight bat"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bat">powercfg -h off<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="开启Windows休眠命令"><a href="#开启Windows休眠命令" class="headerlink" title="开启Windows休眠命令"></a>开启Windows休眠命令</h3><figure class="highlight bat"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bat">powercfg -h on<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
